# name: fx_light_cone
# gen: cone
# size: 28x25
# from: LAMP_LIGHT
# top_width: 6
# max_alpha: 64
# falloff: 1.2
# Baked Bayer 4x4 light cone, hung under each room's lamp and reaching the floor.
# LVGL v9 removed gradient dithering, so the only way to get a believable
# pixel-art falloff is to bake the ordered dither here at asset build time.
#
# The cone must stay mostly transparent: it is light, not paint. falloff 2.2 keeps
# the bright core in the top third and lets the bottom two thirds break up into
# scattered dither pixels, which is what makes the furniture underneath still
# readable while clearly being lit.
